Huh? A weapon? Named after me? Now, THAT would be a teriffic one. Kind of
'Grid Bug Squeezer' :-)

But seriously:

[spoiler]


The only weapons you can name are 'Sting' (elven dagger) and 'Orcrist (two
handed sword). You can name Sting in 3.0 and 3.1, Orcrist as far as I know
only in 3.0 (I once named a two handed sword, identified it and got the
inventory slot 'a +0 two handed ...' instead of 'the +0 Orcrist'). But I can
be false.

Seldom, very seldom they lay around in the dungeon or in shops. But that can
be dangerous though: Last week a dwarf attacked me wielding Grayswandir ...

There are many other ways of obtaining them, but that should be left as
homework for the reader ... :-)

